elieved to exist only in books.<br>Scrolls, symbols, ancient incantations...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there were those who claimed to own magic itself: the <strong>Velgrins</strong>.<br>To them, order was preserved through knowledge, and knowledge was safe only in their hands.<br>But chained knowledge decays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And one day, one of those chains broke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In one of the towers, an apprentice cast a spell without a book. <br>Not with his hands. Not with his voice.<br><strong>With his mind.</strong><br>He thought the spell.<br>And the world heard it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That day, Moonvile tasted fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This kind of power could not be controlled.<br>It didn\u2019t fit into a page.<br>It didn\u2019t follow the rules.<br>And so, the new bearers of magic were cast out from the order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They were called witches. Outcasts. Heretics.<br>But in the end, they all came to be known by one name: <strong>Zaurens</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/3cc52bf03f3e8c58cccc1f4232b164c4.poster.avif?t=1757754860\" width=700 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/3cc52bf03f3e8c58cccc1f4232b164c4.webm?t=1757754860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/3cc52bf03f3e8c58cccc1f4232b164c4.mp4?t=1757754860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Those Who Shape Magic with Thought Now Hunt Those Who Bind It to Books</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velgrins still cling to their spellbooks.<br>Every power they cast needs a page.<br>But that requires time.<br>Focus.<br>And silence.<br>But Moonvile... is not silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moonvile is the graveyard of truths exiled by the towers.<br>A place of magical experiments, shattered minds, and lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now the graves are opening.<br>And the Zaurens are returning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They learned magic not from books, but from <strong>trauma</strong>.<br>Each one carries a spell within their mind.<br>Before casting it, they close their eyes for a few seconds\u2026<br>And they remember:<br>The pain.<br>The betrayal.<br>And then the magic is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velgrins try to escape.<br>They search Moonvile for sacred relics.<br>Because only those relics can save them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no matter how fast they run\u2026<br><strong>The mind is faster than the page.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Zaurens no longer wait in the shadows.<br>They are no longer the hunted.<br>They are the hunters.</p>","developers":["Shadow Wrought Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/d26e44e2546784058f96ecbdd74a3999707a332a/header.jpg?t=1757754860","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175058,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175058/movie480.mp4?t=1756726783","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175058/movie_max.mp4?t=1756726783"},"name":"MoonvileFullGameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175058/0bfb7